Looking at `sqlite_projection_path`:

```rust
pub fn sqlite_projection_path(events_path: &Path) -> PathBuf {
    let dir = events_path.parent().unwrap_or_else(|| Path::new("."));
    let stem = events_path
        .file_stem()
        .unwrap_or_else(|| events_path.as_os_str());
    dir.join(format!("{stem}.db"))
}
```

